### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Create a transfer (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a deposit (201) — no fromAccount needed
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Validation error: negative amount + bad currency (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "ZZZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Currency mismatch on an existing account (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 10,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Filter: by account + type (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer

### Filter: by date range (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Get a transaction by id (200 / 404) — replace <id> with a real id from the list
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/<id>

### Account balance (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Account summary (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary
